             <p>
                    <span>Mr.Lucas Dechasa Biru</span>   <br/>

                    <span>General Manager</span>  <br/>
                    <span>RISE Global GMBH</span> <br/>
                    <span>Subbelrather Strasse 15a</span>  <br/>
